}},{"title":"壬戌首春十九日锁宿玉堂四绝 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"十年前已卜菟裘，老恋君轩不自由。\n衰飒秃翁垂八十，四更烛下作蝇头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29395,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"壬戌首春十九日锁宿玉堂四绝 其三","author":"刘克庄","text":"秀师罪我当犁舌，贺母嗔儿欲吐心。\n老去未偿文字债，始知前世业缘深。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29396,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"壬戌首春十九日锁宿玉堂四绝 其四","author":"刘克庄","text":"搯肾搜肠极苦辛，先贤曾叹费精神。\n瓣香重发来生愿，世世无为识字人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29397,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"壬戌首春十九日锁宿玉堂四绝 其一","author":"刘克庄","text":"无情莲炬剪将残，有样葫芦画不难。\n尽笑翰林麻草拙，谁知老子布衾寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29398,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"天夺","author":"刘克庄","text":"曩造河沙业，今灾梦幻身。\n不知岩下电，天夺与何人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29399,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"天堑","author":"刘克庄","text":"兴亡天数亦人谋，战舰蒙冲一炬休。\n雪浪如山限南北，不湔江令沈侯羞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":29400,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"孔子问礼图","author":"刘克庄","text":"却